:: Night event - feral den
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHT</h1>
<br /><br />
<<set _nightBack = setup.night.backPassage()>>
<<if settings.transEnabled>>
	<<set _fdRoll = random(1, 100)>>
	<<if _fdRoll <= 70>>
		<<newgirl>>
		<<set $tmpGirl.strength = random(35, 65)>>
	<<elseif _fdRoll <= 90>>
		<<newguy>>
		<<set $tmpGirl = $tmpGuy>>
		<<set $tmpGirl.strength = random(40, 70)>>
	<<else>>
		<<newtransgirl>>
		<<set $tmpGirl.strength = random(35, 65)>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if random(1, 100) <= 75>>
		<<newgirl>>
		<<set $tmpGirl.strength = random(35, 65)>>
	<<else>>
		<<newguy>>
		<<set $tmpGirl = $tmpGuy>>
		<<set $tmpGirl.strength = random(40, 70)>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<set $tmpGirl.traits = [...new Set(($tmpGirl.traits ?? []).concat(['feral']))]>>
<<set $tmpGirl.skills = ($tmpGirl.skills ?? []).filter(s => ['woodcraft', 'scavenger', 'fighter'].includes(s))>>
<<set $tmpGirl.washDays = 0>>
<<set $tmpGirl.washBeauty = 0>>
<<set $tmpGirl.location = 'forest'>>
<<set $nightFeral = clone($tmpGirl)>>
<<set _fdHe = setup.pronounceWhat($nightFeral, true)>>
<<set _fdHim = setup.pronounceWho($nightFeral)>>
<<set _fdHis = setup.pronounceWhos($nightFeral)>>
<center>
	<<image 'places/explore/night_feral_den.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
Ferals did their hunting at night. You smelled the den before you saw it: a collapsed underpass with a nest of rags in the back and bones scattered across the concrete, some of them far too big to be rabbit.
<br /><br />
One of them was awake. <<= _fdHe>> was crouched at the mouth of the underpass, perfectly still, head cocked toward the sound you had just made. <<= _fdHe>> had not seen you yet. <<= _fdHe>> would in a moment.
<br /><br />
<div id="fd_leave">
	<<linkreplace 'Back away slowly'>>
		<<run $('#fd_fight').hide()>>
		<<if setup.night.trip()?.mode === 'dark' || setup.percentageChance(50)>>
			You went back the way you came one careful step at a time. The shape at the underpass sniffed the air, made a low sound in <<= _fdHis>> throat and settled again.
			<br /><br />
			<<unset $nightFeral>>
			<<link 'Head back'>>
				<<goto _nightBack>>
			<</link>>
		<<else>>
			Your light caught <<= _fdHim>> full in the eyes. <<= _fdHe>> flinched, then came out of the underpass low and fast, straight at the light.
			<br /><br />
			<<link 'Fight'>>
				<<set $enemies = [clone($nightFeral)]>>
				<<fight $enemies 'Night event - feral den won' _nightBack>>
			<</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="fd_fight">
	<<linkreplace 'Rush the den'>>
		<<run $('#fd_leave').hide()>>
		You closed the distance before <<= _fdHim>> could turn. <<= _fdHe>> met you halfway, all teeth and nails and noise.
		<br /><br />
		<<link 'Fight'>>
			<<set $enemies = [clone($nightFeral)]>>
			<<fight $enemies 'Night event - feral den won' _nightBack>>
		<</link>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>

:: Night event - feral den won
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHT</h1>
<br /><br />
<<set _nightBack = setup.night.backPassage()>>
<<set $tmpGirl = $nightFeral>>
<<set $tmpGirl.happy = Math.max(($tmpGirl.happy ?? 0) - 20, -100)>>
<<set $tmpGirl.relationship = Math.max(($tmpGirl.relationship ?? 0) - 30, -100)>>
<<set $tmpGirl.sub = Math.min(($tmpGirl.sub ?? 0) + 20, 100)>>
<<set _fdHe = setup.pronounceWhat($tmpGirl, true)>>
<<set _fdHim = setup.pronounceWho($tmpGirl)>>
<center>
	<<image 'places/explore/night_feral_down.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
It was over. <<= _fdHe>> lay on the concrete breathing hard, not getting up, watching you from under a curtain of matted hair with the flat patience of an animal that had lost a fight and was waiting to see what came next.
<br /><br />
<<include 'NPC info'>>
<br /><br />
<<if ($game.location.basement ?? false) && $slaves.length < $basementLimit>>
	<div id="fdw_capture">
		<<set _fdCaptureLabel = 'Tie ' + _fdHim + ' up and take ' + _fdHim + ' home'>>
		<<linkreplace _fdCaptureLabel>>
			<<run $('#fdw_leave').hide()>>
			<<statsAdd 'people_captured'>>
			<<run setup.npc.addHistory($tmpGirl, 'captured')>>
			<<run $slaves.push($tmpGirl)>>
			<<unset $nightFeral>>
			You bound <<= _fdHim>> with what was left of your rope and walked <<= _fdHim>> home through the dark.
			<br /><br />
			<strong>Taken as a slave.</strong>
			<br /><br />
			<<link 'Head to the basement'>>
				<<goto 'Basement'>>
			<</link>>
		<</linkreplace>>
	</div>
<</if>>
<div id="fdw_leave">
	<<linkreplace 'Leave'>>
		<<run $('#fdw_capture').hide()>>
		<<unset $nightFeral>>
		You left <<= _fdHim>> in the den and walked away. <<= _fdHe>> did not follow.
		<br /><br />
		<<link 'Head back'>>
			<<goto _nightBack>>
		<</link>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>
